t wieder zu beenden.\', \'type\': \'Beschwörung einer Zecke\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b6f74d-d5bc-4374-8bac-743e9d69f2c3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Lícido acelerador\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37f60bd4-f593-4462-a2c7-664812fd36e5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Litique accélérateur\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2076f6b-74b2-4ede-9cb8-b4570ae42309\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Licide della Velocità\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87682bca-a68c-4531-a566-edddf8f289a8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'活力リシド\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba18d7fe-c9b8-40e9-935f-02b895ad4a07\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Lícide Incitador\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'828059e9-f7df-4eea-9dd6-f8c4364eeb87\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Betäubung', 'text': 'Eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\nZiehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad76d8c1-88fa-4331-ae01-902fcf4e328a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aturdir', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '071a863b-a31b-461b-948a-1f08ee5f6c3e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Etourdissement', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8efbfaee-5c42-46fa-8e39-27e44c68d4c1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Stordire', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ad4a682-c9f3-4c59-b276-9dc6cb1d6242'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '気絶', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e478e658-bfc7-4e28-a8b6-74e4646ff71a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Atordoar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7aa82fcc-e75e-4e56-800e-ac58c338523b'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blitzelementar\', \'text\': \'Für das Blitzelementar gilt die Einsatzverzögerung nicht.\', \'type\': \'Beschwörung eines Elementarwesens\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17cc81a9-f442-4102-a4ce-e7af292f4c73\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de rayos\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e8135bf-0cff-43a3-a3ba-92f8b0b9e92c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Elémental d\'éclair", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4229ee46-b09c-475b-866b-034ce155ec6a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elementale dei Fulmini\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e512106b-b5b8-4180-ba0f-e89101536211\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の精霊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f4ed9e5-e86d-4e74-b666-9793ea07386a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental do Relâmpago\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a0399dd-dbcd-493f-9061-c1db8420b68d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzstrahl\', \'text\': \'Der Blitzstrahl fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler Deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'337cde28-6ade-4a21-87a0-8aa496c3bf26\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ráfaga de rayos\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661e9873-711a-4864-9d7d-e02809a8aad1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Salve d\'éclair", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'597dd687-