uguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8e925d5-65ba-4e54-9668-d9e9bd68e3dd'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Froschzunge', 'text': 'Ziehe eine Karte, wenn die Froschzunge ins Spiel kommt.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f4b2e2a-aadd-4bbc-82db-1053a0f954f9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lengua de rana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd685cb70-294f-475a-b050-982c729c84aa'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Langue de grenouille', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '669e6da7-0a78-468b-87e4-a9d19b524138'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lingua di Rana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f29941d-3fc9-4f98-ae8f-dfd94f543202'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '蛙の舌', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bceab40f-6bfa-4744-b1dd-88eff7d3b29a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Língua de Sapo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c43c0d3f-1964-4573-92c5-6b6d0c974afb'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Fylamarid', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nDer Fylamarid kann nicht von blauen Kreaturen geblockt werden.\\n{U}: Eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl ist blau bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Beschwörung einer Bestie', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12f75943-42ed-4e08-ad4b-98bce138de65'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Filamárido', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e59410b-bba0-40e3-966e-8706c57b032e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Céphalamaride', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c71ff0e9-8903-475a-a4fe-e85c6b0e3850'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Filamaride', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '515726f8-f7aa