rcassa di Phyrexia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7003beb-58dd-41b9-a0a8-268f62deaaa4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ファイレクシアの大男', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f34b3758-1e4e-4fb4-b193-43324597fc04'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Brutamontes Phyrexiano', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbb16fc6-fbb2-4452-b834-ed10ae7422a9'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Phyrexianischer Verknoter', 'text': '2, {T}: Wähle Flugfähigkeit, Erstschlag, Trampeln oder Irrealität. Eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl mit dieser Fähigkeit verliert diese bis zum Ende des Zuges. Eine andere Kreatur Deiner Wahl erhält diese Fähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a655f39e-19e5-47b3-b9e8-28cb6f73a6f8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Variador pirexiano', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '719a1398-aeaf-4bca-ac0b-03ec231ce055'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Episseur phyrexian', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cc89dc6-350e-477e-b3bd-a94c69f5902d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Accoppiatore di Phyrexia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a24f07e6-8324-4450-a064-23e4ffef63ff'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ファイレクシアの接続具', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '110c30e3-9f00-431e-83b6-ff8f9a580831'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Implantador Phyrexiano', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13db428e-4504-45f1-ad82-9e772c40c662'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Plötzlicher Aufprall', 'text': 'Der Plötzliche Aufprall fügt einem Spieler Deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Karten, die dieser auf der Hand hat, zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11a1622c-4f5e-4fd1-9538-d7c21eb9df1c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Impacto súbito', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a2f47f0-ff4c-44f3-b52d-e509393dcd21'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Choc soudain', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9904923a-0747-4caf-888b-397866d2fdd4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Impatto Improvviso', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77bdefd0-5599-4937-87ad-df11afc20ea4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '突然の衝撃', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2753d0a1-6912-40e8-ad9a-4b19e25ab753'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Impacto Súbito', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34e9df00-22c2-42b6-a2cb-fe1ac29d988f'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Propaganda', 'text': 'Kreaturen können nicht angreifen, wenn ihr Beherrscher nicht zusätzlich {2} für diese Kreatur bezahlt.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '281592c2-d4e4-4b6e-9ee9-b9c97335c1f2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Propaganda', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '649da005-6c0c-40f3-b3be-005f2603997e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Propagande', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c4a751f-c686-41ff-8224-4f4736d25ef7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Propaganda', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f329ef4f-1b62-4d56-8ae2-7db8dd1f4904'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'プロパガンダ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f0af79e-9734-4b0d-8714-e7b908972b33'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Propaganda', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe56366d-a9ef-475c-b37b-bca3c18a1c03'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Pulsierender Remasuri', 'text': 'Für alle Remasuris gilt die Einsatzverzögerung nicht.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Remasuris', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa6ac1c4-d246-47c5-8998-e996fd14f9b3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fragmentado enérgico', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2749b3d7-7fed-4461-bf56-1915abfad694'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Slivoïde sanguin', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5345302-70ab-4b94-b806-a4f7e155e5e3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Tramutante Coraggio', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf7436f6-7b51-456c-a997-3c84925e9800'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ハートのスリヴァー', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '929ee1e9-faa2-4a4e-94b6-4c8fad80082a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cardio-Fractius', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70df6983-7f7d-4e50-adef-0ae417e3db79'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Racheengel', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Racheengel aus dem Spiel auf dem Friedhof landet, kannst Du ihn wieder oben auf die Bibliothek seines Besitzers legen.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Engels', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c48523c3-ac06-4bc9-867a-1774ff4b35f9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ángel vengador', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7314d8a-eedf-4cc1-93f0-7c708e22f6c7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ange vengeresse', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bdf6ffb-cbaa-47e2-8807-264cf4d717ee'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Angelo Vendicatore', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b1ec97b-f192-4b10-bdb7-06b44d980b7d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '復讐する天使', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '115f75