original_text: ['(Walls cannot attack.)\\nWall of Diffusion can block creatures with shadow.', 'Add o\\nBo\\nBo\\nB to your mana pool.', 'All Elves gain forestwalk. (If defending player controls any forests, those creatures are unblockable.)\\nElves cannot be the target of spells or abilities.', 'All Slivers are unaffected by summoning sickness.', 'All Slivers gain first strike.', 'All Slivers gain flying.', 'All Slivers gain trample.', 'All Slivers get +1/+1.', 'All artifacts and lands come into play tapped.', 'All creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'All lands are 2/2 creatures. (These creatures still count as lands.)', 'All white creatures get -1/-1.', 'Any player may play a creature card with total casting cost 3 or less whenever he or she could play an instant and without paying its casting cost.', 'Artifacts cannot be the target of spells or abilities.', 'As long as your opponent controls any creatures with flying, Escaped Shapeshifter gains flying. The same is true for first strike, trample, and protection from any color.', "At the beginning of each player's main phase, add o\\nGo\\nG to that player's mana pool.", 'Black creatures cannot attack or block', "Buyback o2 (You may pay an additional o2 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nChange the text of target permanent by replacing all instances of one color word or basic land type with another until end of turn.", "Buyback o2 (You may pay an additional o2 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nPut the top creature card from your graveyard into play. That creature is unaffected by summoning sickness this turn. Remove the creature from the game at end of turn.", "Buyback o2 (You may pay an additional o2 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nSacrifice a creature: Gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nEvincar's Justice deals 2 damage to each creature and player.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nPrevent all damage to you from one source. (Treat further damage from that source normally.)", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nPrevent up to 3 damage to any creature.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nReturn target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nReturn target permanent to owner's hand.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nTarget creature attacks this turn if able.", "Buyback o4 (You may pay an additional o4 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nSearing Touch deals 1 damage to target creature or player.", "Buyback o4 (You may pay an additional o4 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nTarget creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", "Buyback o5 (You may pay an additional o5 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nDraw a card.", 'Caldera Lake comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU or o\\nR to your mana pool. Caldera Lake deals 1 damage to you.', 'Canopy Spider can block creatures with flying.', 'Chaotic Goo comes into play with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\nDuring your upkeep, you may flip a coin. If you win the flip, add a +1/+1 counter to Chaotic Goo. Otherwise, remove a +1/+1 counter from it.', 'Charging Rhino cannot be blocked by more than one creature.', "Choose and discard X cards: Look at target opponent's hand and choose X of those cards. That player discards the chosen cards.", 'Choose and discard X land cards: Destroy X target lands.', 'Choose and discard a card: Regenerate Patchwork Gnomes.', 'Counter target artifact, creature, enchantment, or land ability requiring an activation cost. Abilities of that permanent cannot be played again this turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Counter target spell unless its caster pays an additional o\\nX. If he or she does not, tap all mana-producing lands that player controls and remove all mana from his or her mana pool.', 'Counter target spell with total casting cost equal to X.', 'Counter target spell.', 'Counter target spell.\\nDraw a card.', 'Creatures deal no combat damage this turn. Gain 1 life for each attacking creature.', "Creatures with power 3 or greater do not untap during their controllers' untap phases.", 'Destroy X target nonblack creatures. Draw X cards.', 'Destroy all creatures of any creature type of your choice.', 'Destroy all creatures with no enchantments on them. Those creatures cannot be regenerated this turn.', 'Destroy all enchantments.', 'Destroy all green creatures. Those creatures cannot be regenerated this turn.', 'Destroy all islands.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact, creature, or land. Aftershock deals 3 damage to you.', 'Destroy target artifact.', "Destroy target enchantment. Gain life equal to that enchantment's total casting cost.", 'Destroy target land.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature. That creature cannot be regenerated this turn.', 'Destroy two target nonblack creatures. Lose 5 life.', 'Double all damage assigned to any creature or player.', 'Draw three cards. Choose two cards from your hand and put both on either the top or the bottom of your library.', "During each player's upkeep, Ancient Runes deals 1 damage to that player for each artifact he or she controls.", "During each player's upkeep, put a Saproling token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 green creature.", 'During your upkeep, Jinxed Idol deals 2 damage to you.\\nSacrifice a creature: Target opponent gains control of Jinxed Idol permanently.', 'During your upkeep, if there are no Reflection tokens in play, put a Reflection token into play. Treat this token as a 2/2 white creature.\\no0: Destroy target Reflection.', 'During your upkeep, if you have five or more cards in your hand, Thumbscrews deals 1 damage to target opponent.', 'During your upkeep, if you have three or fewer cards in your hand, Scalding Tongs deals 1 damage to target opponent.', 'During your upkeep, put a pain counter on Torture Chamber.\\nAt the end of your turn, Torture Chamber deals 1 damage to you for each pain counter on it.\\no1, oc\\nT, Remove all pain counters from Torture Chamber: Torture Chamber deals 1 damage for each pain counter on it to target creature.', "During your upkeep, you may look at the top card of target opponent's library. You may then put that card on the bottom of his or her library.", 'During your upkeep, you may look at the top three cards of your library and put them back in any order.', "During your upkeep, you may put a treasure counter on Legacy's Allure.\\nSacrifice Legacy's Allure: Permanently gain control of target creature with power no greater than the number of treasure counters on Legacy's Allure.", 'Each Sliver gains "o2, Sacrifice this creature: Draw a card."', 'Each Sliver gains "o2, Sacrifice this creature: Target player discards a card at random. Play this ability as a sorcery."', 'Each Sliver gains "o2: Regenerate this creature."', 'Each Sliver gains "o2: This creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn."', 'Each Sliver gains "o2: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'Each creature loses all abilities and is a 1/1 creature.', 'Each turn, each creature cannot attack you unless its controller pays an additional o2 for that creature.', 'Enchanted creature cannot attack or block.', "Enchanted creature cannot attack, block, or play any ability requiring an activation cost. That creature's controller may sacrifice a permanent to ignore this ability until end of turn.\\no1o\\nU: Return Volrath's Curse to owner's hand.", "Enchanted creature gains flying.\\no\\nU: Return Shimmering Wings to owner's hand.", 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+5.', 'Enchanted creature gets +2/+2.', 'Enchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nIf enchanted creature is the target of a spell or ability, destroy that creature. The creature cannot be regenerated this turn.', 'Enchanted creature gets +X/+0.', 'Enchanted creature gets -2/-2.', 'Enchanted creature neither deals nor receives combat damage.', 'First strike', 'First strike\\nDuring your upkeep, if your opponents control no creatures, Kezzerdrix deals 4 damage to you.', 'First strike\\nIf Renegade Warlord attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'First strike\\no\\nG: Regenerate Ranger en-Vec.', 'First strike\\no\\nR: Sandstone Warrior gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'First strike\\no\\nW: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', 'First strike\\no\\nWo\\nW: Knight of Dawn gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Flying', 'Flying, first strike', 'Flying; swampwalk (If defending player controls any swamps, this creature is unblockable.)', 'Flying\\nChoose and discard a creature card: Skyshroud Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nFylamarid cannot be blocked by blue creatures.\\no\\nU: Target creature is blue until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nIf Angelic Protector is the target of a spell or ability, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nIf Avenging Angel is put into any graveyard from play, you may put Avenging Angel on top of owner's library.", 'Flying\\nIf Flailing Drake blocks or is blocked by any creature, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nSelenia, Dark Angel counts as an Angel.\\nPay 2 life: Return Selenia to owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhen Cloudchaser Eagle comes into play, destroy target enchantment.', 'Flying\\nWhen Rathi Dragon comes into play, sacrifice two mountains or sacrifice Rathi Dragon.', 'Flying\\nWhen you play Dracoplasm, sacrifice any number of creatures.\\nDracoplasm comes into play with power equal to the total power of the sacrificed creatures and toughness equal to the total toughness of those creatures.\\no\\nR: Dracoplasm gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nYou cannot play Skyshroud Condor unless you have successfully cast another spell this turn.', 'Flying\\no1, Discard a card at random: Canyon Drake gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\no1o\\nB: Regenerate Screeching Harpy.', 'Flying\\no\\nB: Pit Imp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. You cannot spend more than o\\nBo\\nB in this way each turn.', 'Flying\\no\\nR: Firefly gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\no\\nR: Flowstone Wyvern gets +2/-2 until end of turn.', "Flying\\noc\\nT, Tap two creatures you control: Return target permanent to owner's hand.", "Flying\\noc\\nT: All non-Wall creatures target opponent controls attack this turn if able. At end of turn, destroy each of those creatures that did not attack. Use this ability only during target opponent's turn and only before combat.", 'Flying\\noc\\nT: Mawcor deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', 'For each 1 damage dealt to Jackal Pup, it deals 1 damage to you.', 'Forestwalk (If defendi